OL,4,Ahomes plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FChris Dodds, representing Gleeson, said
OL,7,Fthe pedestrian route would support
OL,8,Faccess into Brotton and would "narrow
OL,9,Fin as you get further up", with a
OL,10,Fbarrier to restrict bikes and
OL,11,Fmotorbikes.
